        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>MNG 842, French Twist 8 Inch Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe French Twist Cabinet Pull is a timeless design that will always be a classic in luxury homes. This beautiful kitchen cabinet pull is elegant no matter which of the available finish color options you choose. Made by MNG Hardware, the 8 Inch Diameter French Twist Pull is beloved for its effortless style. Each pull comes packaged with mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis cabinet pull is part of the <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=MNG+French+Twist\">MNG French Twist Collection</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the MNG 842 French Twist 8 Inch Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Base Material: Zinc </li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 8-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screws and 1-1/2\"  long #8-32 screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i> \r\n</p>",
